        "ImageDescription": {
          "value": "<br>\n<dl><dd>K\u0151ris Community Garden on a J\u00f3zsefv\u00e1ros Municipality owned corner plot. Est. 2024 (2021?).  There are 40 individual/family and 4 teaching plots. In the Garden, educational activities that shape perspectives, mulching, and water-saving cultivation methods are particularly important. They also operate a community composting system. With the participation of the community, several insect hotels have been established, and many bird feeders and water stations have been installed. - Photo taken on Budapest100 2025 event. Budapest 100 Motto in 2025: Public/Green - Focus on urban greenery: parks, inner courtyards, rooftop terraces, green facades, community gardens. - 4/b K\u0151ris Street= 11 K\u00e1lv\u00e1ria Street, Orczynegyed neighbourhood, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/J%C3%B3zsefv%C3%A1ros\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:J\u00f3zsefv\u00e1ros\">8th district</a> of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Budapest\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Budapest\">Budapest</a>.</dd></dl>",
